# PLACE-026 — keep the Docker build context lean. Mirrors .gitignore's build-artifact exclusions.
# Everything is built FRESH inside the Docker build stages, so host build output is excluded.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.data
docs
delivery
prompts
enterprise-engineering-framework
.claude
